Z||000000||8Ball||07-08-2001||06:34 PM||||Tis me again guys,<P>Well after searching for months and months for a job in my field in this area and not finding anything, I have decided to broaden my search.<P>I am a PC Tech and Network Technician.<BR>I used to own and operate my own shop but due to intense compitetion in this area My poor little store just could not hold up.<P>I have spent the last serveral months working for next to nothing (7.50/hr) as an eletrician and I was laid off from that job.<BR>So now I need a new job and am willing to move anywhere in the world to find one. (Outside of the US would of coarse require sponsorship by the company for my work visa)<P>So if any of you work for a company that is hiring or owns a company maybe you could pass on my resume which I have included as an attachment.<P>Thanks,<P>Randy Walker,<BR>A.K.A. 8Ball<P><BR>hmm ok when I figure out how to attach to this board I will attach my resume. Til then if someone wants it I can email it to them<BR>------------------<BR>The Fieroless Fiero Nut<p>[This message has been edited by 8Ball (edited 07-08-2001).]||||reg||1
